inshu-096","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-096-wanghuifeng-wyd"},{"id":"c-jinshu-096-wanghuifeng:p001","text":"湣懷太子妃王氏，太尉衍女也，字惠風。貞婉有志節。太子既廢居於金墉，衍請絕婚，惠風號哭而歸，行路為之流涕。及劉曜陷洛陽，以惠風賜其將喬屬，屬將妻之。惠風拔劍距屬曰：「吾太尉公女，皇太子妃，義不為逆胡所辱。」屬遂害之。","annotation_status":"reviewed","text_layer":"received_chapter","source_position":{"first_line":36,"last_line":36,"revision_id":2625341,"source_layer":"received_biography","raw_start_codepoint":2384,"raw_end_codepoint":2503,"raw_sha256":"fdde1d9b8b69d7afd9c2f2e9a28a06af7edc213ed3d52f2b040f5e7b0b6c2a15"},"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-096-wanghuifeng:p001:m0000","start":0,"end":4,"surface":"湣懷太子","kind":"person","person_id":"74e_68c_9ae","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-096-wanghuifeng:p001:m0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"王氏","kind":"person","person_id":"y5y_cch_05n","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-096-wanghuifeng:p001:m0010","start":10,"end":11,"surface":"衍","kind":"person","person_id":"b0c_13f_c3a","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-096-wanghuifeng:p001:m0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"惠風","kind":"person","person_id":"y5y_cch_05n","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-096-wanghuifeng:p001:m0033","start":33,"end":34,"surface":"衍","kind":"person","person_id":"b0c_13f_c3a","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-096-wanghuifeng:p001:m0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"惠風","kind":"person","person_id":"y5y_cch_05n","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-096-wanghuifeng:p001:m0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"劉曜","kind":"person","person_id":"fee_97f_681","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-096-wanghuifeng:p001:m0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"惠風","kind":"person","person_id":"y5y_cch_05n","status":"con